# Based on GitHub's Go template. For the allow-list variant, see:
# https://github.com/github/gitignore/blob/main/community/Golang/Go.AllowList.gitignore

# Compiled binaries, plugins, and shared libraries
*.dll
*.dylib
*.exe
*.exe~
*.so

# Test binaries, built with `go test -c`
*.test

# Coverage and profile output
*.out

# Go workspace file
go.work

# Vendored dependencies (uncomment to exclude)
# vendor/

# Generator output kept on gofmt failure (internal/generator/util.go)
*.unformatted

# Compiled SPIR-V shaders (`task` builds these from the .comp sources)
*.spv

# Local tooling state
.claude

# OS cruft
.DS_Store
